# Paths the PR reviewer skips — excluded from the MAX_ADDITIONS /
# MAX_CHANGED_FILES size gate and from the reviewer's context.

# dark-factory pipeline state (specs/prompts are human-gated by the
# dark-factory pipeline's own audit, not the PR reviewer).
# ⚠️ Leading slashes are load-bearing: an unanchored `prompts/` is a
# gitignore pattern that matches a directory of that name at ANY depth,
# so it also swallowed `pkg/prompts/` — the Go package holding this
# repo's own verdict parsers — and every change to them escaped review.
/prompts/
/specs/

# counterfeiter-generated fakes — regenerated by go generate, never hand-edited
mocks/